corid:coin-1934-270-reverse
    a nmo:Reverse ;
    dcterms:description "Head of Aphrodite left, hair rolled with the ends hanging in curls down the neck; wearing earring and necklace; letter A to right"@en ;
    nmo:hasControlmark corid:controlmark-letter-a .

